{"html":"<p>At the Miffy Museum in the Netherlands, here’s a parade of Miffy as people from all over the world picture her.</p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-de9fe7268803da50a8b4145e7545521a_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Blue Miffy</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-358a333aa9ee9287112f67aea6c93c87_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Green</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e2efca1afa28735ad1e35cd0e1ed9e0b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Big black eyes</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6cd3004b2311e18995bec96be013ca87_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Long-faced, rather manly and a little melancholy</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d6bb2e02290c5cdbebacf7465c15b0a2_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Wide-set eyes, head apparently caught in a door</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fdf139534405437dcb07d48c1cbe1a09_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Can fly, and has a pig for a friend</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-49356770c7b1ae3d2587a026dccdd3fa_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Diet failed, still optimistic</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8fc1ce3a9f3aebe4dded6b56a1d65633_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Evolved into a cat</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-91347a7f1a839b46ec76de1719eef34b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>In a little red dress</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f1a3b6de9e16c25737fd5de23c851c90_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Looks like a dog</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d674af843a5dd3520a6dd136dbc20da3_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Polygons everywhere except the head</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5bf23c74a1195a52bad2003a06444f7_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Extended-ear edition</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fc05e63a8100c6193723088a1702b86c_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Loves taking photos</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-18216e2204bfb86a3fa0827b6d14bca2_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Puffer-jacket edition (the best-looking one, in my estimation)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dcf3a9216d446b7de04fe5b4e458f9d9_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Startled, fur standing on end</figcaption></figure><p>Besides everyone’s personal Miffy, there were some other works of art too: abstract, cartoonish, romantic or minimalist; Van Gogh one minute, Picasso the next. For example:</p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3bf7c4c71040b49f58d84e1d7af4048b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>A creepy donkey baring its buck teeth, probably by a Dutch visitor</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ed9fc5fbeafa407693838b9ee6162089_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>A super-cute schoolgirl, by a Japanese visitor</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-f8fb40d36af3a8ec634788981a5bc380_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>An alien version of Sanmao, the three-haired waif of a classic Chinese comic strip. Drawn by an alien?</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b896646f987840d3efe2089945d705b5_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Pokémon and Pikachu are best friends?</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-621469dcbd4d98fe07d35a6924dd8eb6_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Emoji with a giant spider. Can anyone tell me what the Japanese confession underneath says?</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6faa89f34b354e81d9d10718841dc5a0_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>A mysterious woman with a sky-high hairline. What is she holding?</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-60993f47887c4948d680777c6075f2e5_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Something called Serena... a bug? A little girl?</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-af5293f32fdecc2be6109f2f0b996efe_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Octopus demon</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-3111561287b1df5d3cc5d1c4d2e0e95d_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Big Head Son, of the Chinese cartoon <i>Big Head Son and Small Head Dad</i>, as a hair-dyed little punk</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cc01095c317b8aa571f5178bef9b4299_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>Pussy?</figcaption></figure><p>One of these is mine. Seeing that my drawing is on a par with all the little kids’, I feel much better.</p>"}